message: "If you use PowerFlex, please cite this software release."
title: "PowerFlex"
type: software
version: 0.7.0
date-released: 2026-11-01
url: "https://github.com/Hariharan2604-git/PowerFlex"
license: MIT
authors:
  - name: "Hari Haran"
  - name: "Darsani SM"
abstract: >-
  PowerFlex is an independent prototype for exploring read-only, deadline-aware
  advisory scheduling of flexible batch-compute jobs under modeled power,
  electricity-price, and carbon constraints. Its public-trace evaluation is
  limited and mixed; it does not establish general savings or production readiness.
